Package: memdash
Type: Package
Title: Shiny Dashboard for Memgraph via the Python neo4j Driver (reticulate)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jannik", "Vindeløv", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A NeoDash-style Shiny dashboard for Memgraph. Connects over Bolt
    using the official Python 'neo4j' driver through reticulate, runs plain
    openCypher, and renders results as dashboard cards (table, graph with
    igraph/tidygraph/ggraph layouts, scatter/bar/line/pie charts, metric,
    text, JSON). Dashboards can be built interactively, saved as portable
    JSON, reloaded, and shared in read-only mode.
